72	    // workflow's path posts before validation -- the "CI is running" comment a
73	    // person may eventually see comes from validation itself, which never runs when
74	    // its own dispatch failed. (An earlier version of this comment blamed the
75	    // waiting comment this step used to post; that step is gone -- #271 moved the
76	    // comment into validation.)
77	    console.error(`::error::could not dispatch validation for PR #${number}; no agent will run`);
